SalesRequestLineIn.description:
Line shape per type — GOODS_SUPPLY: item, quantity, destination_warehouse_id; GOODS_TRANSFER: item, quantity, source + destination;
PRICE_REVIEW: item, proposed_sale_price (current price filled by the server); NON_SALE_ISSUE: item, quantity, source warehouse,
exit_reason; SALE_TYPE_PERMIT: no lines.
